-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001757073-26-000042"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $40.4m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1757073/000175707326000042/0001757073-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001757073-26-000042"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-4.1% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1757073/000175707326000042/0001757073-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001757073-26-000042"}],"bear":[{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.7% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1757073/000162633726000005/0001626337-26-000005-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 47.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.47,"consecutive":2,"current":0.553,"current_display":"55.3%","threshold_display":"47.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -1.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.01,"consecutive":2,"current":0.144,"current_display":"14.4%","threshold_display":"-1.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this compan